ight: normal; text-decoration: underline; font-style: normal;">first annual=
 report</a> since the program launched. The Whistleblower Program provides =
a confidential mechanism for city employees or officials to report concerns=
 related to fraud, waste, and abuse of city resources. By providing an inde=
pendent and confidential reporting channel, the program helps identify risk=
s, improve accountability, and strengthen public trust in city operations. =
<span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">&#xa0;</span></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0;"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">&#xfeff;</span><=
/p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0;">Calendar year 2025 marked the first full year of th=
e Whistleblower Program. During this year, the Program received 42 new repo=
rts and closed 41 cases. Cases may be closed for several reasons, including=
 completion of an investigation, referral to another department or entity, =
insufficient information to proceed, or because the allegation was outside =
the Program&#x2019;s authority.&#xa0;</p>
